Description: An R interface to the version 5.7 of the 3D-CMCC-FEM
    (<https://www.forest-modelling-lab.com/the-3d-cmcc-model>,
    <https://github.com/Forest-Modelling-Lab/3D-CMCC-FEM>), a fully
    bio-geochemical forest model that simulates storage and fluxes of carbon,
    water and nitrogen in homogeneous and heterogeneous forests with different
    species, ages, diameters and height classes competing for resources. The
    package installs the model executable, prepares and checks the input files
    (also from E-OBS climate data and SoilGrids), ships the species
    parameterizations of the version 5.7, runs single or batches of
    simulations, and reads and plots the outputs.
